cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this audit or its errata lists, please cite it as below. It is
  work in progress and changes often, and it has no numbered releases yet, so
  please also give the commit you used. For Principia Mathematica itself, cite
  the book; for the Lean formalization, cite the companion repository
  principia-mathematica-lean.
type: dataset
title: "Principia Mathematica text audit: errata tracker"
abstract: >-
  A check of the digital texts of Whitehead and Russell's Principia
  Mathematica (first edition, 1910-1913), Project Gutenberg's Volumes I and II
  and Distributed Proofreaders' Volume III in progress, against page images of
  the printed books, so that corrections can be offered back to the people
  who maintain the texts. Candidates are marked as awaiting human check until
  a person has checked them against the scan.
authors:
  - family-names: McGinnis
    given-names: Will
repository-code: "https://github.com/willmcginnis/principia-mathematica-text-audit"
url: "https://github.com/willmcginnis/principia-mathematica-text-audit"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC0-1.0
keywords:
  - Principia Mathematica
  - Project Gutenberg
  - Distributed Proofreaders
  - errata
  - proofreading
  - transcription
